# Interview Prep Kit — environment variables
#
# Your ATS, resume storage (e.g. Google Drive), Slack, and email connect via OAuth, and web search is
# platform-native — so usually NO keys are needed here. Only add a key if your ATS authenticates with
# one. The agent-onboarding skill will prompt you. Add it under Settings → Secrets (preferred) or copy
# this file to .env.

# --- ATS (pick the one you use, if it needs a key) ---
# GREENHOUSE_API_KEY=your-greenhouse-harvest-api-key
# ASHBY_API_KEY=your-ashby-api-key
# LEVER_API_KEY=your-lever-api-key
